## Next Steps

If I had more time, I would continue improving both the functionality and user 
experience of the site.
One improvement would be adding interactive filtering or search functionality, 
so users can quickly find recipes instead of scrolling through categories.
I would also enhance the design by adding more micro-interactions and animations,
such as smoother transitions between pages or hover effects for images.
Another potential improvement would be adding more staff in the About page. I 
might add more about my personal experiences in cooking dishes and some photos as 
well.
Finally, I would continue expanding the site by adding more recipes and possibly 
organizing them with tags or difficulty levels to make the content more structured 
and user-friendly.